  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">本模组修复了小型物体（雪、按钮、草等）阻碍铁傀儡生成的问题</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_857b15b2-9c34-435c-b9cd-eeee262ae774.gif\" alt=\"模组演示视频\" width=\"476\" height=\"268\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">兼容对象：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">按钮</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">蜡烛</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">地毯</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">雪</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">小型植物</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">花朵</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">花盆</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁傀儡生成动画</a>兼容！&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">灵感来源于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋灵生成修复</a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3af387\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3af387\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgolem-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth页面</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/eFjWWvNphY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITIIVc1.jpeg\" alt=\"Discord邀请链接\" width=\"358\" height=\"98\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/boboMCmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EGs51Y.png\" alt=\"Patreon赞助链接\" width=\"360\" height=\"96\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbo_bo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J5FW8zh.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi捐赠链接\" width=\"366\" height=\"74\"></a></p>",
